# Banking APIs

This specification defines the APIs for Data Holders exposing Banking endpoints.

```diff
Updated request headers in authenticated endpoints, resulting in new versions:
 - Get Accounts
 - Get Account Detail
 - Get Bulk Balances
 - Get Balances For Specific Accounts
 - Get Account Balance
 - Get Transactions For Account
 - Get Transaction Detail
 - Get Direct Debits For Account
 - Get Bulk Direct Debits
 - Get Direct Debits For Specific Accounts
 - Get Scheduled Payments for Account
 - Get Scheduled Payments Bulk
 - Get Scheduled Payments For Specific Accounts
 - Get Instalment Plans for Account
 - Get Instalment Plans Bulk
 - Get Payees
 - Get Payee Detail

- x-fapi-auth-date
- x-fapi-customer-ip-address
+ x-fapi-end-user-present
```

